                "indent": 0,
                "direction": null,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1,
                    "text": "By sending an order (i.e. proposal for conclusion of the contract) the Purchaser confirms that he/she is familiar with these trade terms and conditions and that he/she fully agrees with them in their entirety. The Purchaser is obliged to present the content of these trade terms and conditions to all the Clients participating in the activities.",
