                    "style": ""
                  }
                ]
              },
              {
                "type": "paragraph",
                "version": 1,
                "format": "",
                "indent": 0,
                "direction": null,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1,
                    "text": "In case of conclusion of the contract online, the consumer can appeal with their claim and requests to Online Dispute Resolution Platform (ODR platform) in terms of extrajudicial resolution. The consumer can do so online at http://ec.europa.eu/consumers/odr/ . The contact place for resolving disputes online in the Czech Republic is the European Consumer Centre (ESC): www.evropskyspotrebitel.cz, email: esc@coi.cz. The email of the Provider in case of extrajudicial resolution of disputes is info@rockbusters.net.",
                    "format": 0,
