                "indent": 0,
                "direction": null,
                "children": [
                  {
                    "type": "text",
                    "version": 1,
                    "text": "If the contract was concluded by the distant means of communication (either online or by phone) the consumer can withdraw from the contract within fourteen days of conclusion of the contract. Withdrawing from the contract is not possible after completing the participation of the activities.",
